  Text: |-
    Easy Teleprompter keeps your slides and speaker notes floating in front of you while you present. Change slides with the arrow buttons under each slide, by pushing a wrist into the Previous or Next pad, by saying "next" or "previous" after turning on the mic, or by tapping the left or right half of a paired phone.
    
    Pinch Ok to begin. Drag the panel by its frame to move it.
