    Slide 5.  Table of Contents 
    [Show Table of Content] 
    
    > I am going to keep it clean and straight to the point, and don’t forget to save your questions and keep them for our final Q & A session. 
    
    > We are going to cover all these in the next 12 minutes. That’s hard to believe, but watch me do it. 

